		Bestiary: {
			ImportantFlavorText: Important Flavor Text!
			KingVon: King Von was not a rapper who sometimes killed people... He was a serial killer who occasionally raped people!
			FreakyTien: The greatest siege player, out on a rampage, shooting sticky substances on whoever he lays his eyes on...
			Ahmod: The master of aggravation, riding atop a tamed nimbus. His only drive is to enrage the lives of others. When close to death, he tries to suicide bomb the closest target.
			FaeSlime: Slimers that have absorbed vast amounts of fae energy. They no longer spread evil, instead spreading the essence of fae everywhere they go.
			WarlockGolem: A destructive golem hell-bent on causing destruction everywhere. Beware the exploding fireballs!
			RadiantMeleeCreep: sex offender
			RadiantRangedCreep: victim
			HellfireSpirit: When a demon is exposed to hellfire essence their dastardly hatred deep in their bodies supercharges, to the point where it materializes into a spirit that can only be released on the hosts death.
			TwilightDrover: Whenever a creature token leaves the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.
			Scav: Amidst the chaos and lawlessness, scarcity of vital provisions and territories, the first to lift up their heads are shady characters, unembarrassed by excessive moral or ethical restraints or quick to lose them under influence of conditions.
			WanderingJellyfish: An airborne creature, capable of flight using a combination of gases in its clear hull. Like the Jellyfish on earth, they also use pulsation to aid in locomotion.
		}

